        "content": "This dashboard reads `systemd-journal` across the homelab. The `Alloy / Docker Warnings + Errors` panel only shows matches from `alloy.service` and `docker.service`.\n\nInventory hosts wired to this dashboard: `01-backup-lxc`, `01-dns-lxc`, `01-edge-lxc`, `01-media-vm`, `01-observability-lxc`, `01-reverse-proxy-lxc`, `01-tailscale-lxc`, `01-torrent-lxc`."
      }
